## General Setup
#### The usual
1. Create repo in Github
2. Clone repo 
3. CD to repo folder
#### Create server and client folder
```sh
mkdir server client
```
#### Run npm init
```sh
npm init -y
```
#### Edit package.json
```json
{
  "name": "react-ucbsf",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "main": "index.js",
  "license": "MIT",
  "scripts": {
    "install": "cd client && npm install",
    "heroku-postbuild": "cd client && npm run build",
    "start": "node server"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "express": "^4.17.1"
  }
}
```
